        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Professional Services: We have industry-leading expertise in designing, implementing, integrating and installing customized solutions into both traditional and newly created platforms.",
        "start_character": 6945,
        "end_character": 7129
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To reinforce our culture, we operate according to the Agilysys Code of Business Conduct, available on our website http://www.agilysys.com, which mandates full compliance with applicable laws and regulations and helps to preserve the integrity of our Company.",
        "start_character": 37827,
        "end_character": 38085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading developer and marketer of software-enabled solutions and services to the hospitality industry, including software solutions fully integrated with third party hardware and operating systems;",
        "start_character": 4593,
        "end_character": 4799
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete with other full-service providers who sell and deliver bundled POS and PMS solutions comprised of software, hardware, subscription, maintenance, and professional services.",
        "start_character": 41609,
        "end_character": 41791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we compete with PMS systems that are designed and maintained in-house by large hotel chains.",
        "start_character": 41995,
        "end_character": 42100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In fiscal 2004, we acquired Inter-American Data, Inc., which allowed us to become the leading developer and provider of technology solutions for hotel property management and inventory management in the casino and resort industries.",
        "start_character": 1860,
        "end_character": 2092
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our culture impacts the quality of the employees we hire, the way we develop and maintain solutions, and the way we communicate and interact with our customers and each other.",
        "start_character": 37527,
        "end_character": 37702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We offer our employees pay and benefits packages that we believe are competitive with others throughout our industry, as well as within the local markets in which we operate, and align individual performance with our success.",
        "start_character": 38238,
        "end_character": 38463
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate across the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Asia-Pacific, and India with headquarters located in Alpharetta, GA.",
        "start_character": 34580,
        "end_character": 34713
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-234423",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-234423-79eb340733f93b1b",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-234423",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "These companies, some of which are much larger than we are, include Oracle Corp., Shiji and Infor.",
